
Code:
 1- toy.py: runs the toy simulation; produces a Pickle file
   example:
     python toy.py --noise real --output source

 2- analysis.py: analysis of the output of the hybrid toys; can read multiple files and takes care of the Truth IDs; produces PDFs as csv files
   example:
     python analysis.py --input source --config config-source.py

 3- fit.py: fit with multiple PDFs both the Truth and the Reco (PDFs are hardcoded in the file)
   example:
     python -i analysis.py --input /data/questdmc/users/franchinip/QUEST/ND3/toy/all_ --config config.py

---

Condor submission in the Oxford cluster:
  condor_submit job.submit
